# Large textbook scans — kept on local disk only, never committed.
#
# GitHub Pages cannot serve Git LFS objects: it returns the 130-byte pointer
# file instead of the document. Storing these in the repo therefore consumed
# the account's LFS storage and bandwidth budget for no benefit, and an
# exhausted budget blocked every push to GitHub.
/textbook/Signal&system/*.pdf
/textbook/magnetelectronics/David-K-Cheng-Field-and-Wave-Electromagnetics-z-lib-org-pdf.pdf
/textbook/magnetelectronics/solution-manual.pdf

